OL,3,GNEWSAParades Commission holds meetings
OL,4,Aover Drumcree parade
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Parades Commission has begun a
OL,7,Fseries of meetings about the Drumcree
OL,8,Fdispute as it weighs up whether to
OL,9,Fallow a controversial Orange Order
OL,10,Fmarch to go ahead this weekend.
OL,12,FThe order wants to parade along the
OL,13,Fmainly-nationalist Garvaghy Road area
OL,14,Fof Portadown on Sunday afternoon.
OL,16,FIt is one of the most contentious
OL,17,Fparade routes in Northern Ireland.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,414,410,260,120,0,100
