OL,3,GNEWSAParades Commission holds meetings
OL,4,Aover Drumcree parade
OL,5,
OL,6,FBreandan Mac Cionnaith and other
OL,7,Fmembers of the Garvaghy Road Residents
OL,8,FCoalition met the five-person
OL,9,Fcommission in Belfast for more than an
OL,10,Fhour on Tuesday afternoon.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
